              "x": 526,
              "y": 324,
              "size": 12,
              "mark": "cross",
              "on_value": "no"
            }
          ],
          "help": "(continued) … years and if you have lost the sight of one eye after the said period of five years and if the application is for driving a light motor vehicle other than a transport vehicle fitted with an outside mirror on the steering wheel side) or with one eye, at a distance of 25 metres in good day light (with glasses, if worn) a motor car number plate?"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_c_limbs",
          "type": "radio",
          "label": "(c) Have you lost either hand or foot or are you suffering from any defect of muscular power of either arm or leg?",
